 "text": "Hello, how's life treating you? Plan for them. Serve food on plates, not in holders on the ground, and keep drinks in lidded container. Some people swear by them. Sprinkle the cinnamon mix around the rim just before you stop eating. Keep sweets in a box or jar out of their reach and well above the ground. Wasps love sugar. Use lemon wedge in drink bowl and splash it with water before you put it away. Water bottles are great, and each person gets their own.",
